Control-engine roster (corrected per Codex v4 review)
-----------------------------------------------------
The minimal control set is FOUR independent engines. Thumbmark is one of them.
- FingerprintJS OSS **v5 is MIT** (the BSL concern was about v4) — NOW VENDORED
  alongside Thumbmark. See ../fingerprintjs/NOTICE.md.
- CreepJS (MIT) — PENDING: extract only the useful raw sections into a renamed,
  self-hosted adapter under our namespace control.consistency.* (no upstream UI/
  backend; trademark-safe rename).
- FPScanner (MIT) — PENDING: verify + pin by commit, adapt the useful checks.

Thumbmark telemetry: sampled logging is disabled (logging:false) so it makes no
external requests on the measurement stand. See ../../../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
